OL,3,GNEWSACancer care time of day 'could
OL,4,Ainfluence outcomes'
OL,5,
OL,6,FProf Paul Lorigan, consultant medical
OL,7,Foncologist at The Christie NHS
OL,8,FFoundation Trust in Manchester and
OL,9,Fsenior author of the study, said: "The
OL,10,Fmost important message from this
OL,11,Fresearch is that there appears to be a
OL,12,Fsignal worth investigating further."
